{"title":"Ahoy!! 우리는 호쇼해적단☆","artist":"호쇼 마린","sourceId":"reference:XjhES25W2sX4C0ItKn00","sourceHash":"ad20b8f20262c385f04e944df4a3d1b6456f1fb9da9eb21097dc62d2d8f22eda","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":24687346,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":6.85,"end":9.52,"text":"海賊なら Yo-Ho! (Yo-Ho!) 踊れ叫べ Yo-Ho! (Yo-Ho!)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":9.52,"end":14.06,"text":"さぁ今旗のもとへ (Hi Hi Hi Hi Ohhhhh)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":14.06,"end":19.4,"text":"宝鐘海賊団「出航～！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":19.4,"end":22.39,"text":"(Ahoy! Ahoy! Ahoy! Ahoy!)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":22.39,"end":25.25,"text":"踊る Ahoy! に見る Ahoy! （ホイホーイ！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":25.25,"end":28.08,"text":"（Ahoy! Ahoy! Ahoy! ホイホイホーイ！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":28.08,"end":30.49,"text":"「全速前進だ〜！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":30.49,"end":36.06,"text":"進め！（進め！）太陽はサンサン 大航海日和だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":36.06,"end":41.84,"text":"歌え！（歌え！）最高のテンション 波の音に乗せて ドンブラコ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":41.84,"end":44.44,"text":"海でガールズ PARTY","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":44.44,"end":47.44,"text":"陸で兄貴が HAPPY (Fu-Fu!)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":47.44,"end":52.14,"text":"お空ではドクロくん ヒラヒラ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":52.14,"end":58.08,"text":"山奥ボロボロマイハウスで夢を見て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":58.08,"end":65.64,"text":"「あん、神様ぁ、いつかこのマリンを本物の海賊に... してくだたぁ〜い」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":65.64,"end":71.21000000000001,"text":"声を上げてさぁ出航だ 我ら宝鐘海賊団","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":71.21000000000001,"end":77.28,"text":"コンパス片手に旗を揚げ この海をジャックしちゃおう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":77.28,"end":82.62,"text":"ヨーソロー！ついておいで 共に Yo-Ho Yo-Ho 叫ぼう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":82.62,"end":91.72,"text":"嗚呼 最高の日々 ようこそ我が船へ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":91.72,"end":94.53999999999999,"text":"(Ahoy! Ahoy! Ahoy! Ahoy!)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":94.53999999999999,"end":97.25999999999999,"text":"踊る Ahoy! に見る Ahoy! （ホイホーイ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":97.25999999999999,"end":99.97,"text":"（Ahoy! Ahoy! Ahoy! ホイホイホーイ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":99.97,"end":102.59,"text":"「一、二、サンバ！サンバ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":102.59,"end":108.08,"text":"熱く！（熱く！）語ろうよ パッション 思いを解き放て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":108.08,"end":113.62,"text":"赤く！（赤く！）煌めく ファッション 形から入るタイプです","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":113.62,"end":119.52000000000001,"text":"発車10秒前 走れ ガチ恋列車 (Fu-Fu)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":119.52000000000001,"end":124.28,"text":"夕焼けも照れるワ ギラギラ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":124.28,"end":130.28,"text":"じんわり汗も滴るイイ女だけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":130.28,"end":137.5,"text":"「あん、神様ぁ、船長はセンシティブだと、BANされちゃうのですね〜！はにゃん」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":137.5,"end":143.11,"text":"奪われたら 取り戻せ それが 宝鐘海賊団","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":143.11,"end":149.47,"text":"キミたちとなら辿り着ける 伝説のエルドラド (Go Go!)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":149.47,"end":154.53,"text":"ヨーソロー！楽しけりゃ 歌え Yo-Ho Yo-Ho パーリナイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":154.53,"end":163.36,"text":"嗚呼 この景色 大切な仲間よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":163.36,"end":169.02,"text":"宴だ宴！騒げや騒げ！踊るAhoy!に見るAhoy!（ホイホーイ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":169.02,"end":174.75,"text":"同じアホなら飲まなきゃソンソン！酒樽片手に いっきまっすよーそれっ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":174.75,"end":177.55,"text":"Ahoy! Ahoy! (Ahoy! Ahoy!)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":177.55,"end":180.58,"text":"Ahoy! Ahoy! (Ahoy! Ahoy!)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":180.58,"end":186.07,"text":"宝鐘マリン！（宝鐘マリン！）世界で1番？（かわいいよ〜！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":186.07,"end":188.86,"text":"メスガキ！メスガキ！（メスガキ！メスガキ！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":188.86,"end":191.77,"text":"エロガキ！エロガキ！（エロガキ！エロガキ！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":191.77,"end":194.06,"text":"ボンキュッボーン！（ボンキュッボーン！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":194.06,"end":197.32,"text":"お嬢ちゃんパンツ何色...？（パンツはいてませーん！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":197.32,"end":202.91,"text":"お宝！お宝！（お宝！お宝！） 魔剤？魔剤？（魔剤！魔剤！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":202.91,"end":205.35,"text":"撫でますドン！（撫でますドン！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":205.35,"end":208.64,"text":"船長のちょっといいとこ（「見てみたい〜！」）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":208.64,"end":211.48,"text":"あはんあは〜ん！（もっと！もっと！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":211.48,"end":214.25,"text":"うふんうふ〜ん！（もっと！もっと！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":214.25,"end":217.09,"text":"セクシービーム！（もっと！もっと！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":217.09,"end":219.82,"text":"いやーん マイチング〜！（もっと！もっと！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":219.82,"end":222.68,"text":"だっちゅーの！（もっともっともっとー！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":222.68,"end":225.53,"text":"サービスサービスぅ！（もっともっともっとー！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":225.53,"end":228.57999999999998,"text":"萌え萌えキュン （もっともっともっとー！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":228.57999999999998,"end":232.35,"text":"出会って5秒で（即出航〜！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":232.35,"end":236.63,"text":"あぁんもう！船長は、キミたちをそんな子に育てた覚えはありません！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":236.63,"end":239.97,"text":"ほんとにぃ〜〜、めっ、だぞ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":239.97,"end":244.87,"text":"立てば痴女 座れば昭和 歩く姿はセンシティブ...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":244.87,"end":250.35,"text":"夢を見よう この船で 後悔なんてさせない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":250.35,"end":256.66,"text":"キミたちのおかげで私は 船長になれるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":256.66,"end":259.46,"text":"「ミラクル船長キャノン、打てーー！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":259.46,"end":261.65,"text":"「ブヒィィィィィィ〜〜〜」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":261.65,"end":267.47,"text":"声を上げて さぁ出航だ 我ら 宝鐘海賊団","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":267.47,"end":273.52,"text":"コンパス片手に旗を揚げ この海をジャックしちゃおう (Go Go!)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":273.52,"end":279.09000000000003,"text":"ヨーソロー！ついておいで 共に Yo-Ho Yo-Ho 叫ぼう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":279.09000000000003,"end":287.83,"text":"嗚呼 最高の日々 ようこそ我が船へ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":287.83,"end":293.55,"text":"宝鐘の海賊団","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":293.55,"end":300.45,"text":"「それでは行きますよ〜〜！出航〜！」（ヨーソロー！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}